<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Allianz raised at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Allianz raised at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurer Allianz was raised to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said Allianz should benefit from the merger of Hypo-Bank and Vereinsbank though increased distribution and a greater &quot;free float&quot; in its shares.</p>
<p>CSFB also upped its 12-month price target on Allianz shares to 560 marks from 400 marks.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
